*OCTANAL  = octanal
*NONANAL  = nonanal (an aldehyde in the “cooking mix”)
*DECANAL  = decanal (an aldehyde in the “cooking mix”)
*UDECANAL = undecanal
*DDECANAL = dodecanal
*
*HEXENAL  = 2-hexenal
